{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3313","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3313","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3313\",\"parent_revision\":\"b4a32f54de9d08dc327967766962e76d7bfb8810\",\"root_revision\":\"4e40a563d85c643467e46aa0941bfe329aa881dd6b58b9eea2cc223cf2a560db\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: needs-grooming\\nadded: 2026-08-29\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nplugins/development-harness/skills/implement-feature/SKILL.md:140, step 4's general post-task concerns-block handler (the one that appends any dispatched task agent's returned `<concerns>` block to the backlog item \u2014 not specific to contract-verification), hardcodes `selector=\\\"#{issue}\\\"`.\\n\\nThis is the exact same bug class just fixed for `dh:contract-verification` in #3276 (PR #3286): verified via `find_item`/`parse_issue_selector` (plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/parsing.py) that a bare beads nanoid like `bd-a3f8` resolves correctly via the string-ID exact-match path, but a `#`-prefixed form like `#bd-a3f8` matches neither `parse_issue_selector`'s numeric path nor `find_item`'s string-ID exact match \u2014 it silently fails to resolve. A bare GitHub issue number and a bare beads nanoid both resolve correctly without the `#` prefix.\\n\\nImpact: on a Beads-backed backlog item, any task agent's `<concerns>` block reported during `/dh:implement-feature`'s step 4 would silently fail to append to the item's Concerns section \u2014 the same \\\"concerns silently dropped\\\" symptom #3276 was filed to fix, just at a different call site.\\n\\nOut of scope for #3276/PR #3286: that PR's diff never touches this line (step 4 is the general task-agent concerns handler; #3276's scope was specifically contract-verification.md and groom/error.md). Fixing it here would be scope creep on an already-merged review; tracked separately per this item.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Flagged by qg-T1 (dh:code-reviewer) during #3276's Quality Gate T1 Code Review, as a non-blocking follow-up outside that PR's diff scope\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-29\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"9ac0d508e23ed84fdeaa29569a8e65e3a29705bdc2367d0f8196a3d4ea2811a3\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABYnN2yA\",\"fields\":{\"followup_to\":\"\",\"close_reference\":\"\",\"added\":\"2026-08-29\",\"layer\":\"\",\"research_first\":\"\",\"source\":\"Not specified\",\"priority\":\"P2\",\"language\":\"\",\"suggested_location\":\"\",\"status\":\"needs-grooming\",\"close_reason\":\"\",\"stack\":\"\",\"item_type\":\"Bug\",\"close_comment\":\"\",\"files\":\"\",\"topic\":\"\",\"groomed\":\"\",\"plan\":\"\"}}"}